# Public showcase repo: documentation and results only, no source code.
# Whitelist model — ignore everything, then re-include only the showcase files.
# The full source stays on disk locally but is never tracked here.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# experiment/out screenshots (referenced by the README) — nothing else
!/experiment/
/experiment/*
!/experiment/out/
/experiment/out/*
!/experiment/out/*.jpg
